  "details": "Usually, worlds have one image and that's it. What if someone wants to see what it looks like but can't join at the moment? If additional images or heck, even videos were added, people could preview a world. Don't know if video players can be set up for menus, especially for Quest. If needed, this feature can just be additional images.\n\nAnd I don't mean only visible on the website. I mean being able to open the game and see everything when viewing a world. Perhaps a Gallery tab could be added to world pages.",
